2 CONT
2 CONT Christoffer von Schlippenbach, Lord of Klein-Salingen and Wiltzing, both in Courland. Lieutenant. Died according to the source in 1648. First wife: Anna Maria von Manteuffel (Zöge). Daughter of Johan Carlsson von Manteuffel (Zöge)
2 CONC , land councilor (?) of the bishopric of Pilten, Katzdangen, Blondin and Kukurren, and Elisabet Gerhardsdotter von Nolden (of Hasenpoth). Second wife: Margareta von Fölckersam.
