2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT OTTO REINHOLD VON ADERKAS a. Tackfer, Sallajöggi, und Pennijöggi, was bu. 29.xii.1707, Ksp. Poenal[1]. On 13.ii.1686 he was confirmed as owner of Sallajöggi[2]. He was a lieutenant in the Swedish service by 1696 and a Rittmeister 
2 CONC at the time of his death[3]. He oo BARONESSE ANNA MARGARETHA VON LIEVEN a.d.H. Weissenfeld, who + 8.iv.1703,[4] and, as "die Fr. Rittmeisterin Aderkaß", was bu. 3.i.1704, Ksp. Poenal.[5]
2 CONT
