1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ingeburg Countess Of HOLSTEIN     
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeburg Countess Of was born about 1316 in Of, , Oldenburg, Germany.  Ingeburg Countess Of's father was Gerhard V Count Of HOLSTEIN and her mother is Anastasie Countess Of SCHWERIN-WITTENBERG.  Her paternal grandparents were Gerh
2 CONC ard II Count Of HOLSTEIN and Ingeborg VALDEMARSDOTTER (FOLKUNGA) PRINCES OF SWEDEN; her maternal grandparents were Nikolaus I Count Of SCHWERIN and Miroslawa, Princess Of POMERANIA. She had a brother named Gerhard V, Count Of.  Sh
2 CONC e was the younger of the two children.  She died before 1340.
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad I Count Of OLDENBURG & Ingeburg Countess Of HOLSTEIN   
2 CONT
2 CONT They were partners, the type of relationship is unspecified.  They had three sons and three daughters, named Konrad II Count Of, Gerhard Count Of, Christian V Count Of, Agnes Countess Of, Ingeburg Countess Of and Anastasia Countes
2 CONC s Of.
2 CONT
