2 CONT Anna Julianna von Blomberg is one of 6 children between Jacob Ludwig von Blomberg and Margaretha Dorathea von Behr.
2 CONT all 6 children are:
2 CONT Anna Julianna von Blomberg born 08 Jul 1693, died 30 Jul 1743, married to Johann Melchior von Funck
2 CONT Maria Eleonora von Blomberg (no dates listed), married on 01 Jan 1716 to Ernst Edwald von Heyking
2 CONT Anna Sybilla Baronesse von Blomberg, born 1701 of Sernaten, died 29 May 1781, married Otto Friedrich von Schroeders
2 CONT Diedrich Wilhelm von Blomberg, died 01 Jan 1724
2 CONT Johann Ulrich von Blomberg (no dates), married Sybilla von Blomberg
2 CONT Jacob Ludwig von Blomberg (no dates), married Elisabeth Eleonore von Rosenberg
2 CONT
2 CONT All can be seen on the source: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSPJ-5BYR?i=203&ca... (seek pg 204 of 391, which is Tab 19
2 CONT (the entire von Blomberg family tree is located there, as are MANY others
