1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Why does von Ungern has the Sternberg coat of arms?
2 CONT
2 CONT The c-o-a has a Stern (star) and a Berg (hill) in it. What connects it to Hungary? Yes, there are mountains in Hungary, and you can see stars from there. But is it reason enough to use the wrong c-o-a?
