1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaretha was not a member of the "Hastfer" family. Instead, she was a member of the "Holstfer" family (see "[https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb10782583?page=131&q=Holstfer Neue nordische Miscellaneen.
2 CONC  9/10. 1794]"). Her parents were Christian von Holstfer a. Rujen and Magdelene Taube (see the "[https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb10782878?page=213&q=Holstfer Kurländische Güter-Chroniken. Band 1]").
2 CONT * according to ancestor lists for the Hahn and Korff families published in [https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/view/bsb10782585?page=189 Neue nordische Miscellaneen. 13/14. 1796, page 185] and [https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/v
2 CONC iew/bsb10782585?page=230 page 226], her mother was from the Uexkull family, so Magdalene Taube might have been her stepmother
