2 CONT Prince Franciszek Lubomirski (died 1721) was a Polish noble (szlachcic).
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Court and Grand Marshal Stanisław Herakliusz Lubomirski and Elżbieta Doenhoff.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was owner of Rzeszów, Połonne and Łańcut, and General of the Crown Army. In 1721 he committed suicide.
