1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * '''Tönnes Maydell''', who came from a German-Baltic noble dynasty that had lived in Etsonia for centuries, was a cavalry captain in fieldmarshall Gustav Horn's regiment and owned Wredenhagen and Sompah estates in
