2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Aleksander Koniecpolski (1620–1659) was a Polish nobleman. He became the Grand Standard-Bearer of the Crown in 1641, the Palatine of Sandomierz Voivodeship in 1656, and the Starost of Perejasław, Korsun, Płoskirow and Dolin
2 CONC a. He was the son of the famous hetman Stanisław Koniecpolski.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aleksander_Koniecpolski_(1620%E2%80%931659)
2 CONT
